rdens, Nightlife","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"rkZsld6EP8r_iYRba7ug8Q","review_id":"MEBRhm88IJCpkk-xvnva3w","date":"2020-10-16T06:28:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9414787292480469,"text_excerpt":"COVID-19 Update: I live in this neighborhood and have been wanting to go to Wrong Iron since it opened but was deterred bc their parking lot was always full so I never bothered. But during this pandemic I was able to finally visit. I scoped it out earlier in the day when I was going on a socially distant walk with a friend of mine and asked the host what pandemic protocols they were following. He assured me that everyone is required to wear a mask to get in until you get to your seat. You're not allowed to mingle with other tables. The first time is a warning and the second time you will be asked to leave. And if you leave your table you have to put your mask back on. He also said all of ..."},{"business_id":"rkZsld6EP8r_iYRba7ug8Q","review_id":"Tn53YMv5o_9gC183ECc_PA","date":"2019-08-22T04:35:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9399760961532593,"text_excerpt":"What a fun place! I like any spot that lets the dogs join the party, has a great outdoor space and terrific food available for cheap! They have a regular food truck on site that has a great pork sandwich and tonight's visiting food stall was a Vietnamese place that has fantastic shrimp bao buns. (2 for $8) They even have cocktails on draft inside so you don't have to be a beer fan. It's not the kind of place where the bartenders have any interest in helping you find your favorite beer, so if you're not schooled in it already, skip it cuz they're a little snotty about it. I heard two different bartenders start off indifferent and move towards annoyed with two customers in front of me so I ..."},{"business_id":"rkZsld6EP8r_iYRba7ug8Q","review_id":"vg7wnX9DJgv2CinztKr0FQ","date":"2019-07-25T17:38:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9388778209686279,"text_excerpt":"So happy I came here, It's my new fav place! They have a huge outdoor area featuring a food truck, pop up kitchen, TVs, & Cornhole. I got a frozen Moscow mule & a blueberry lemonade cocktail & my friend got some beers - both were enjoyed & we left a lil tipsy. I came on a Wednesday around 7 & parking was very difficult to find but the place had plenty of seating. This is also a dog friendly establishment so be prepared for barking all night."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rkZsld6EP8r_iYRba7ug8Q","photo_id":"c8E1t-IJM00H5wfn_LvxjA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/c8E1t-IJM00H5wfn_LvxjA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8757467269897461},{"business_id":"rkZsld6EP8r_iYRba7ug8Q","photo_id":"Y7FBP_4mCx9XgjkOLeusYA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Y7FBP_4mCx9XgjkOLeusYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8635030388832092},{"business_id":"rkZsld6EP8r_iYRba7ug8Q","photo_id":"0gaElbPDkPDQoNB3IcWSMA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/0gaElbPDkPDQoNB3IcWSMA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8223423957824707},{"business_id":"rkZsld6EP8r_iYRba7ug8Q","photo_id":"3PP41zFie_qzq3rtuGwHkw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/3PP41zFie_qzq3rtuGwHkw.jpg","visual